    "chunk_text": "Ic eom mare \u00feonne \u00fees middangeard, l\u00e6sse \u00feonne hondwyrm, leohtre \u00feonne mona, swiftre \u00feonne sunne. S\u00e6s me sind ealle flodas on f\u00e6\u00f0mum ond \u00fees foldan bearm, grene wongas. Grundum ic hrine, helle underhnige, heofonas oferstige, wuldres e\u00feel, wide r\u00e6ce ofer engla eard, eor\u00fean Saga hw\u00e6t ic hatte..",
